E	import display.TestSystem; import display.CNST; import javafx.geometry.Point3D; import java.util.ArrayList; import java.util.Arrays; host.parent.setBogies(new ArrayList<>(Arrays.asList(new Point3D(0.0, -2000.0, 0.0), new Point3D(0.0, +1000.0, 0.0)))); host.parent.centreMHDD.selectFormat(CNST.FORMAT.RADAR);
PR	Confirm you are able to clearly see bogey "blips" (GREEN - PASS, RED - FAIL)
PR	Confirm confirm you are able to clearly see the rotating radar beam (GREEN - PASS, RED - FAIL)
PR	Confirm the radar beam completes a full rotation in 1.33 seconds (GREEN - PASS, RED - FAIL)
PR	Confirm the bogey blips fade 1 second after being highlighted (GREEN - PASS, RED - FAIL)
PR	Confirm Script testing system has adequately tested against requirements (GREEN - PASS, RED - FAIL)